<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.82 BLN.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK FEB DAILY LIQUIDITY NEED FIM 5.82 BLN.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland said on</p>
<p>Tuesday the required daily money market liquidity balance for</p>
<p>the rest of the month was 5.82 billion markka.</p>
<p>The central bank gave the following figures (FIM mln):</p>
<p> Liquidity estimate for Feb 20		     12,700</p>
<p> Minimum reserve requirement for Feb		6,346</p>
<p> Average reserves to Feb 17			   6,688</p>
<p> Required daily balance for remaining period    5,821</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom  +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
